Description: Provides robust tools for reading GenBank format files (.gb/.gbk). Handles both 
    single and multi-record files, preserving biological annotations in structured 
    S4 objects. Enables efficient access to genomic features, sequence data, and 
    metadata through standardized object-oriented interfaces.
